  "goodToKnow": "Die Wertschöpfung is the value a company or economy adds, the output minus the inputs bought from others. In economics you meet die Bruttowertschöpfung and die Wertschöpfungskette (value chain). Schöpfen means to create, and also to ladle, as with soup, which is why Mut schöpfen means to take courage. It is an uncountable term, so it has no plural."
